$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{1}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{1}{2}\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{1}{4}}^{0} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{0} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(- \\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{6},\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{0}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left(0\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{12}.\n$$"] [:db/add "faeff81c-1bda-54ce-8635-ef5efe9f62ef" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "faeff81c-1bda-54ce-8635-ef5efe9f62ef" :question/answer-fields "af2cf4bf-2732-5219-aae7-62e6dacd4fd2"] [:db/ensure "faeff81c-1bda-54ce-8635-ef5efe9f62ef" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "faeff81c-1bda-54ce-8635-ef5efe9f62ef"] [:db/add "745e1aab-f6c3-5e91-9b42-28a49b50f687" :answer/id #uuid "745e1aab-f6c3-5e91-9b42-28a49b50f687"] [:db/add "745e1aab-f6c3-5e91-9b42-28a49b50f687" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "745e1aab-f6c3-5e91-9b42-28a49b50f687" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\pi}{40}"] [:db/ensure "745e1aab-f6c3-5e91-9b42-28a49b50f687" :answer/validate] [:db/add "95eeba75-f7cb-582d-9614-a666dc6b1787" :answer/id #uuid "95eeba75-f7cb-582d-9614-a666dc6b1787"] [:db/add "95eeba75-f7cb-582d-9614-a666dc6b1787" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "95eeba75-f7cb-582d-9614-a666dc6b1787" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{10}"] [:db/ensure "95eeba75-f7cb-582d-9614-a666dc6b1787" :answer/validate] [:db/add "40033031-1b4b-545b-b91a-61c608493633" :answer/id #uuid "40033031-1b4b-545b-b91a-61c608493633"] [:db/add "40033031-1b4b-545b-b91a-61c608493633" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "40033031-1b4b-545b-b91a-61c608493633" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{5}"] [:db/ensure "40033031-1b4b-545b-b91a-61c608493633" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f52c8514-c00a-5c00-af9a-090007b206fd" :answer/id #uuid "f52c8514-c00a-5c00-af9a-090007b206fd"] [:db/add "f52c8514-c00a-5c00-af9a-090007b206fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f52c8514-c00a-5c00-af9a-090007b206fd" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\pi}{20}"] [:db/ensure "f52c8514-c00a-5c00-af9a-090007b206fd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7d4d4b9b-89c7-52ba-89de-a8b5b6ceef7b" :answer/id #uuid "7d4d4b9b-89c7-52ba-89de-a8b5b6ceef7b"] [:db/add "7d4d4b9b-89c7-52ba-89de-a8b5b6ceef7b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7d4d4b9b-89c7-52ba-89de-a8b5b6ceef7b" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "7d4d4b9b-89c7-52ba-89de-a8b5b6ceef7b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "696f9700-be1d-59b3-b201-c8d34a6bbed5" :answer-field/id #uuid "696f9700-be1d-59b3-b201-c8d34a6bbed5"] [:db/add "696f9700-be1d-59b3-b201-c8d34a6bbed5" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "696f9700-be1d-59b3-b201-c8d34a6bbed5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "696f9700-be1d-59b3-b201-c8d34a6bbed5" :answer-field/choices "745e1aab-f6c3-5e91-9b42-28a49b50f687"] [:db/add "696f9700-be1d-59b3-b201-c8d34a6bbed5" :answer-field/choices "95eeba75-f7cb-582d-9614-a666dc6b1787"] [:db/add "696f9700-be1d-59b3-b201-c8d34a6bbed5" :answer-field/choices "40033031-1b4b-545b-b91a-61c608493633"] [:db/add "696f9700-be1d-59b3-b201-c8d34a6bbed5" :answer-field/choices "f52c8514-c00a-5c00-af9a-090007b206fd"] [:db/add "696f9700-be1d-59b3-b201-c8d34a6bbed5" :answer-field/choices "7d4d4b9b-89c7-52ba-89de-a8b5b6ceef7b"] [:db/add "696f9700-be1d-59b3-b201-c8d34a6bbed5" :answer-field/correct "f52c8514-c00a-5c00-af9a-090007b206fd"] [:db/ensure "696f9700-be1d-59b3-b201-c8d34a6bbed5" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "7e848776-98b6-587b-8d7e-6e39a34f98ec" :question/id #uuid "7e848776-98b6-587b-8d7e-6e39a34f98ec"] [:db/add "7e848776-98b6-587b-8d7e-6e39a34f98ec" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{1}{5}}^{0} \\frac{3}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value."] [:db/add "7e848776-98b6-587b-8d7e-6e39a34f98ec" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{3}{5}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{1}{5}&\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{1}{5}}^{0} \\frac{3}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int_{-1}^{0} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(-1 \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{4},\\quad \\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{-1}^{0}\\right)=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\left(0\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 \\pi}{20}.\n$$"] [:db/add "7e848776-98b6-587b-8d7e-6e39a34f98ec" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "7e848776-98b6-587b-8d7e-6e39a34f98ec" :question/answer-fields "696f9700-be1d-59b3-b201-c8d34a6bbed5"] [:db/ensure "7e848776-98b6-587b-8d7e-6e39a34f98ec" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "7e848776-98b6-587b-8d7e-6e39a34f98ec"] [:db/add "c5198f31-2a27-5440-96d8-786d3e5b37d3" :answer/id #uuid "c5198f31-2a27-5440-96d8-786d3e5b37d3"] [:db/add "c5198f31-2a27-5440-96d8-786d3e5b37d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c5198f31-2a27-5440-96d8-786d3e5b37d3" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{6}"] [:db/ensure "c5198f31-2a27-5440-96d8-786d3e5b37d3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4126bb2e-adb1-5c84-aa81-bb8baff44860" :answer/id #uuid "4126bb2e-adb1-5c84-aa81-bb8baff44860"] [:db/add "4126bb2e-adb1-5c84-aa81-bb8baff44860" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4126bb2e-adb1-5c84-aa81-bb8baff44860" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{8}"] [:db/ensure "4126bb2e-adb1-5c84-aa81-bb8baff44860" :answer/validate] [:db/add "97e48d49-d461-5a37-9ce8-29eae33d10c3" :answer/id #uuid "97e48d49-d461-5a37-9ce8-29eae33d10c3"] [:db/add "97e48d49-d461-5a37-9ce8-29eae33d10c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "97e48d49-d461-5a37-9ce8-29eae33d10c3" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "97e48d49-d461-5a37-9ce8-29eae33d10c3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "60703cd4-5113-5fa7-9aec-b6df4bd49021" :answer/id #uuid "60703cd4-5113-5fa7-9aec-b6df4bd49021"] [:db/add "60703cd4-5113-5fa7-9aec-b6df4bd49021" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "60703cd4-5113-5fa7-9aec-b6df4bd49021" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{12}"] [:db/ensure "60703cd4-5113-5fa7-9aec-b6df4bd49021" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9ef74460-5fc0-5fa5-9a48-eb85dae4f55b" :answer/id #uuid "9ef74460-5fc0-5fa5-9a48-eb85dae4f55b"] [:db/add "9ef74460-5fc0-5fa5-9a48-eb85dae4f55b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9ef74460-5fc0-5fa5-9a48-eb85dae4f55b" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "9ef74460-5fc0-5fa5-9a48-eb85dae4f55b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1fa34c3d-730d-5376-be99-d70dc15ead93" :answer-field/id #uuid "1fa34c3d-730d-5376-be99-d70dc15ead93"] [:db/add "1fa34c3d-730d-5376-be99-d70dc15ead93" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "1fa34c3d-730d-5376-be99-d70dc15ead93" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "1fa34c3d-730d-5376-be99-d70dc15ead93" :answer-field/choices "c5198f31-2a27-5440-96d8-786d3e5b37d3"] [:db/add "1fa34c3d-730d-5376-be99-d70dc15ead93" :answer-field/choices "4126bb2e-adb1-5c84-aa81-bb8baff44860"] [:db/add "1fa34c3d-730d-5376-be99-d70dc15ead93" :answer-field/choices "97e48d49-d461-5a37-9ce8-29eae33d10c3"] [:db/add "1fa34c3d-730d-5376-be99-d70dc15ead93" :answer-field/choices "60703cd4-5113-5fa7-9aec-b6df4bd49021"] [:db/add "1fa34c3d-730d-5376-be99-d70dc15ead93" :answer-field/choices "9ef74460-5fc0-5fa5-9a48-eb85dae4f55b"] [:db/add "1fa34c3d-730d-5376-be99-d70dc15ead93" :answer-field/correct "60703cd4-5113-5fa7-9aec-b6df4bd49021"] [:db/ensure "1fa34c3d-730d-5376-be99-d70dc15ead93" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "837b2f87-f619-55e2-a896-14f85a03de55" :question/id #uuid "837b2f87-f619-55e2-a896-14f85a03de55"] [:db/add "837b2f87-f619-55e2-a896-14f85a03de55" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{4}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value."] [:db/add "837b2f87-f619-55e2-a896-14f85a03de55" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{1}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{4}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{12}.\n$$"] [:db/add "837b2f87-f619-55e2-a896-14f85a03de55" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "837b2f87-f619-55e2-a896-14f85a03de55" :question/answer-fields "1fa34c3d-730d-5376-be99-d70dc15ead93"] [:db/ensure "837b2f87-f619-55e2-a896-14f85a03de55" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "837b2f87-f619-55e2-a896-14f85a03de55"] [:db/add "5360c5f2-a9d3-5d7c-9d8a-ba1b505ae347" :answer/id #uuid "5360c5f2-a9d3-5d7c-9d8a-ba1b505ae347"] [:db/add "5360c5f2-a9d3-5d7c-9d8a-ba1b505ae347" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5360c5f2-a9d3-5d7c-9d8a-ba1b505ae347" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "5360c5f2-a9d3-5d7c-9d8a-ba1b505ae347" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3932f765-7547-562d-afae-f73d7fbcb06c" :answer/id #uuid "3932f765-7547-562d-afae-f73d7fbcb06c"] [:db/add "3932f765-7547-562d-afae-f73d7fbcb06c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3932f765-7547-562d-afae-f73d7fbcb06c" :answer/value "\\frac{9 \\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "3932f765-7547-562d-afae-f73d7fbcb06c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b4452519-2fad-53b7-8ea6-6892f1593f29" :answer/id #uuid "b4452519-2fad-53b7-8ea6-6892f1593f29"] [:db/add "b4452519-2fad-53b7-8ea6-6892f1593f29" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b4452519-2fad-53b7-8ea6-6892f1593f29" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{2}"] [:db/ensure "b4452519-2fad-53b7-8ea6-6892f1593f29" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c9821e18-335c-519b-9d68-c0a3ac869c58" :answer/id #uuid "c9821e18-335c-519b-9d68-c0a3ac869c58"] [:db/add "c9821e18-335c-519b-9d68-c0a3ac869c58" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c9821e18-335c-519b-9d68-c0a3ac869c58" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "c9821e18-335c-519b-9d68-c0a3ac869c58" :answer/validate] [:db/add "478cca3c-97ca-560f-bcb2-7c829d3fb755" :answer/id #uuid "478cca3c-97ca-560f-bcb2-7c829d3fb755"] [:db/add "478cca3c-97ca-560f-bcb2-7c829d3fb755" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "478cca3c-97ca-560f-bcb2-7c829d3fb755" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{6}"] [:db/ensure "478cca3c-97ca-560f-bcb2-7c829d3fb755" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0b2c08ac-1207-5551-9040-a992b2d2ed63" :answer-field/id #uuid "0b2c08ac-1207-5551-9040-a992b2d2ed63"] [:db/add "0b2c08ac-1207-5551-9040-a992b2d2ed63" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "0b2c08ac-1207-5551-9040-a992b2d2ed63" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "0b2c08ac-1207-5551-9040-a992b2d2ed63" :answer-field/choices "5360c5f2-a9d3-5d7c-9d8a-ba1b505ae347"] [:db/add "0b2c08ac-1207-5551-9040-a992b2d2ed63" :answer-field/choices "3932f765-7547-562d-afae-f73d7fbcb06c"] [:db/add "0b2c08ac-1207-5551-9040-a992b2d2ed63" :answer-field/choices "b4452519-2fad-53b7-8ea6-6892f1593f29"] [:db/add "0b2c08ac-1207-5551-9040-a992b2d2ed63" :answer-field/choices "c9821e18-335c-519b-9d68-c0a3ac869c58"] [:db/add "0b2c08ac-1207-5551-9040-a992b2d2ed63" :answer-field/choices "478cca3c-97ca-560f-bcb2-7c829d3fb755"] [:db/add "0b2c08ac-1207-5551-9040-a992b2d2ed63" :answer-field/correct "c9821e18-335c-519b-9d68-c0a3ac869c58"] [:db/ensure "0b2c08ac-1207-5551-9040-a992b2d2ed63" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "02ac7814-feae-502f-a5b0-0a640bad7add" :question/id #uuid "02ac7814-feae-502f-a5b0-0a640bad7add"] [:db/add "02ac7814-feae-502f-a5b0-0a640bad7add" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{3}} \\frac{3}{9 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value."] [:db/add "02ac7814-feae-502f-a5b0-0a640bad7add" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{1}{3}&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{3}} \\frac{3}{9 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{1}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{4}.\n$$"] [:db/add "02ac7814-feae-502f-a5b0-0a640bad7add" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "02ac7814-feae-502f-a5b0-0a640bad7add" :question/answer-fields "0b2c08ac-1207-5551-9040-a992b2d2ed63"] [:db/ensure "02ac7814-feae-502f-a5b0-0a640bad7add" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "02ac7814-feae-502f-a5b0-0a640bad7add"] [:db/add "d56f8eb6-4eea-58db-91fc-a658254d61fd" :answer/id #uuid "d56f8eb6-4eea-58db-91fc-a658254d61fd"] [:db/add "d56f8eb6-4eea-58db-91fc-a658254d61fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d56f8eb6-4eea-58db-91fc-a658254d61fd" :answer/value "2 \\pi"] [:db/ensure "d56f8eb6-4eea-58db-91fc-a658254d61fd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b991d596-5c81-5fef-953f-6ad07e4155bb" :answer/id #uuid "b991d596-5c81-5fef-953f-6ad07e4155bb"] [:db/add "b991d596-5c81-5fef-953f-6ad07e4155bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b991d596-5c81-5fef-953f-6ad07e4155bb" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{8}"] [:db/ensure "b991d596-5c81-5fef-953f-6ad07e4155bb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "23246fd1-dc06-50aa-b924-e61fb296c779" :answer/id #uuid "23246fd1-dc06-50aa-b924-e61fb296c779"] [:db/add "23246fd1-dc06-50aa-b924-e61fb296c779" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "23246fd1-dc06-50aa-b924-e61fb296c779" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "23246fd1-dc06-50aa-b924-e61fb296c779" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7aeb8a37-14af-5879-bbc4-cd2450113d70" :answer/id #uuid "7aeb8a37-14af-5879-bbc4-cd2450113d70"] [:db/add "7aeb8a37-14af-5879-bbc4-cd2450113d70" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7aeb8a37-14af-5879-bbc4-cd2450113d70" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\pi}{16}"] [:db/ensure "7aeb8a37-14af-5879-bbc4-cd2450113d70" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8c3c6127-41db-5b5b-af9e-6d7023161148" :answer/id #uuid "8c3c6127-41db-5b5b-af9e-6d7023161148"] [:db/add "8c3c6127-41db-5b5b-af9e-6d7023161148" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8c3c6127-41db-5b5b-af9e-6d7023161148" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\pi}{8}"] [:db/ensure "8c3c6127-41db-5b5b-af9e-6d7023161148" :answer/validate] [:db/add "83d66584-da5c-5036-88e2-4d3d78ce270e" :answer-field/id #uuid "83d66584-da5c-5036-88e2-4d3d78ce270e"] [:db/add "83d66584-da5c-5036-88e2-4d3d78ce270e" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "83d66584-da5c-5036-88e2-4d3d78ce270e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "83d66584-da5c-5036-88e2-4d3d78ce270e" :answer-field/choices "d56f8eb6-4eea-58db-91fc-a658254d61fd"] [:db/add "83d66584-da5c-5036-88e2-4d3d78ce270e" :answer-field/choices "b991d596-5c81-5fef-953f-6ad07e4155bb"] [:db/add "83d66584-da5c-5036-88e2-4d3d78ce270e" :answer-field/choices "23246fd1-dc06-50aa-b924-e61fb296c779"] [:db/add "83d66584-da5c-5036-88e2-4d3d78ce270e" :answer-field/choices "7aeb8a37-14af-5879-bbc4-cd2450113d70"] [:db/add "83d66584-da5c-5036-88e2-4d3d78ce270e" :answer-field/choices "8c3c6127-41db-5b5b-af9e-6d7023161148"] [:db/add "83d66584-da5c-5036-88e2-4d3d78ce270e" :answer-field/correct "b991d596-5c81-5fef-953f-6ad07e4155bb"] [:db/ensure "83d66584-da5c-5036-88e2-4d3d78ce270e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "45987194-c381-5d45-a67a-878e85bf93e8" :question/id #uuid "45987194-c381-5d45-a67a-878e85bf93e8"] [:db/add "45987194-c381-5d45-a67a-878e85bf93e8" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{1}{8}}^{0} \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{1 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value."] [:db/add "45987194-c381-5d45-a67a-878e85bf93e8" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{3}{4}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{1}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{1}{2}\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{1}{8}}^{0} \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{1 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\int_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{0} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(- \\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{6},\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{0}\\right)=\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\left(0\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{8}.\n$$"] [:db/add "45987194-c381-5d45-a67a-878e85bf93e8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "45987194-c381-5d45-a67a-878e85bf93e8" :question/answer-fields "83d66584-da5c-5036-88e2-4d3d78ce270e"] [:db/ensure "45987194-c381-5d45-a67a-878e85bf93e8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "45987194-c381-5d45-a67a-878e85bf93e8"] [:db/add "d9a46c37-dfb6-570e-99b6-69e27c29809c" :answer/id #uuid "d9a46c37-dfb6-570e-99b6-69e27c29809c"] [:db/add "d9a46c37-dfb6-570e-99b6-69e27c29809c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d9a46c37-dfb6-570e-99b6-69e27c29809c" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{5}"] [:db/ensure "d9a46c37-dfb6-570e-99b6-69e27c29809c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9a5d1d7e-e693-53c0-b7e2-238d58141848" :answer/id #uuid "9a5d1d7e-e693-53c0-b7e2-238d58141848"] [:db/add "9a5d1d7e-e693-53c0-b7e2-238d58141848" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9a5d1d7e-e693-53c0-b7e2-238d58