nswer-field/correct "9a5d1d7e-e693-53c0-b7e2-238d58141848"] [:db/ensure "c5cb26e3-8759-56b5-bb30-313381ee7280" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "10a86c5d-b9dc-5297-ab21-4f6e03f59eca" :question/id #uuid "10a86c5d-b9dc-5297-ab21-4f6e03f59eca"] [:db/add "10a86c5d-b9dc-5297-ab21-4f6e03f59eca" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{1}{5}}^{0} \\frac{2}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value."] [:db/add "10a86c5d-b9dc-5297-ab21-4f6e03f59eca" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{2}{5}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{1}{5}&\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{1}{5}}^{0} \\frac{2}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int_{-1}^{0} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(-1 \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{4},\\quad \\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{-1}^{0}\\right)=\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\left(0\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{10}.\n$$"] [:db/add "10a86c5d-b9dc-5297-ab21-4f6e03f59eca" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "10a86c5d-b9dc-5297-ab21-4f6e03f59eca" :question/answer-fields "c5cb26e3-8759-56b5-bb30-313381ee7280"] [:db/ensure "10a86c5d-b9dc-5297-ab21-4f6e03f59eca" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "10a86c5d-b9dc-5297-ab21-4f6e03f59eca"] [:db/add "ce6bc08f-8eed-50f7-8ce0-d6396cded99c" :answer/id #uuid "ce6bc08f-8eed-50f7-8ce0-d6396cded99c"] [:db/add "ce6bc08f-8eed-50f7-8ce0-d6396cded99c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ce6bc08f-8eed-50f7-8ce0-d6396cded99c" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{10}"] [:db/ensure "ce6bc08f-8eed-50f7-8ce0-d6396cded99c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5e4c11c1-503a-5f4e-9d8b-b90474f087ce" :answer-field/id #uuid "5e4c11c1-503a-5f4e-9d8b-b90474f087ce"] [:db/add "5e4c11c1-503a-5f4e-9d8b-b90474f087ce" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "5e4c11c1-503a-5f4e-9d8b-b90474f087ce" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "5e4c11c1-503a-5f4e-9d8b-b90474f087ce" :answer-field/choices "ce6bc08f-8eed-50f7-8ce0-d6396cded99c"] [:db/add "5e4c11c1-503a-5f4e-9d8b-b90474f087ce" :answer-field/correct "ce6bc08f-8eed-50f7-8ce0-d6396cded99c"] [:db/ensure "5e4c11c1-503a-5f4e-9d8b-b90474f087ce" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e99bd3d1-b2c7-55da-9169-4f058c9afd0b" :question/id #uuid "e99bd3d1-b2c7-55da-9169-4f058c9afd0b"] [:db/add "e99bd3d1-b2c7-55da-9169-4f058c9afd0b" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{5} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 25}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "e99bd3d1-b2c7-55da-9169-4f058c9afd0b" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{5}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 25=25\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{5})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=5\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{2}{25}\\cdot 5=\\frac{2}{5}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=5&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{5} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 25}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{1}\\right)=\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{10}.\n$$"] [:db/add "e99bd3d1-b2c7-55da-9169-4f058c9afd0b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "e99bd3d1-b2c7-55da-9169-4f058c9afd0b" :question/answer-fields "5e4c11c1-503a-5f4e-9d8b-b90474f087ce"] [:db/ensure "e99bd3d1-b2c7-55da-9169-4f058c9afd0b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "e99bd3d1-b2c7-55da-9169-4f058c9afd0b"] [:db/add "b4efd285-7561-56f4-bccc-435c7e27f225" :answer/id #uuid "b4efd285-7561-56f4-bccc-435c7e27f225"] [:db/add "b4efd285-7561-56f4-bccc-435c7e27f225" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b4efd285-7561-56f4-bccc-435c7e27f225" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "b4efd285-7561-56f4-bccc-435c7e27f225" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c2c51ac5-8776-5b03-b151-314d5edb2a90" :answer-field/id #uuid "c2c51ac5-8776-5b03-b151-314d5edb2a90"] [:db/add "c2c51ac5-8776-5b03-b151-314d5edb2a90" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "c2c51ac5-8776-5b03-b151-314d5edb2a90" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c2c51ac5-8776-5b03-b151-314d5edb2a90" :answer-field/choices "b4efd285-7561-56f4-bccc-435c7e27f225"] [:db/add "c2c51ac5-8776-5b03-b151-314d5edb2a90" :answer-field/correct "b4efd285-7561-56f4-bccc-435c7e27f225"] [:db/ensure "c2c51ac5-8776-5b03-b151-314d5edb2a90" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "46f7c08c-b23a-52df-8bc9-26e935781bdc" :question/id #uuid "46f7c08c-b23a-52df-8bc9-26e935781bdc"] [:db/add "46f7c08c-b23a-52df-8bc9-26e935781bdc" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "46f7c08c-b23a-52df-8bc9-26e935781bdc" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}=4\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{4})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 4=2$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=2&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right)=2\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "46f7c08c-b23a-52df-8bc9-26e935781bdc" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "46f7c08c-b23a-52df-8bc9-26e935781bdc" :question/answer-fields "c2c51ac5-8776-5b03-b151-314d5edb2a90"] [:db/ensure "46f7c08c-b23a-52df-8bc9-26e935781bdc" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "46f7c08c-b23a-52df-8bc9-26e935781bdc"] [:db/add "cd2d16ed-0a22-517d-aff0-2fc17e5cbd6c" :answer/id #uuid "cd2d16ed-0a22-517d-aff0-2fc17e5cbd6c"] [:db/add "cd2d16ed-0a22-517d-aff0-2fc17e5cbd6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cd2d16ed-0a22-517d-aff0-2fc17e5cbd6c" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{15}"] [:db/ensure "cd2d16ed-0a22-517d-aff0-2fc17e5cbd6c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1749ef1b-b7dd-5332-b751-7e02c047f761" :answer-field/id #uuid "1749ef1b-b7dd-5332-b751-7e02c047f761"] [:db/add "1749ef1b-b7dd-5332-b751-7e02c047f761" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "1749ef1b-b7dd-5332-b751-7e02c047f761" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "1749ef1b-b7dd-5332-b751-7e02c047f761" :answer-field/choices "cd2d16ed-0a22-517d-aff0-2fc17e5cbd6c"] [:db/add "1749ef1b-b7dd-5332-b751-7e02c047f761" :answer-field/correct "cd2d16ed-0a22-517d-aff0-2fc17e5cbd6c"] [:db/ensure "1749ef1b-b7dd-5332-b751-7e02c047f761" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "29922848-0161-5ee9-b650-fe402a88aa8f" :question/id #uuid "29922848-0161-5ee9-b650-fe402a88aa8f"] [:db/add "29922848-0161-5ee9-b650-fe402a88aa8f" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{5 \\sqrt{3}}{3}} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 25}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "29922848-0161-5ee9-b650-fe402a88aa8f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{5}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 25=25\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{5})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=5\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{2}{25}\\cdot 5=\\frac{2}{5}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{5 \\sqrt{3}}{3}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{5 \\sqrt{3}}{3}} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 25}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}}\\right)=\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{15}.\n$$"] [:db/add "29922848-0161-5ee9-b650-fe402a88aa8f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "29922848-0161-5ee9-b650-fe402a88aa8f" :question/answer-fields "1749ef1b-b7dd-5332-b751-7e02c047f761"] [:db/ensure "29922848-0161-5ee9-b650-fe402a88aa8f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "29922848-0161-5ee9-b650-fe402a88aa8f"] [:db/add "524fb952-2eab-5a48-87d8-266780ca5971" :answer/id #uuid "524fb952-2eab-5a48-87d8-266780ca5971"] [:db/add "524fb952-2eab-5a48-87d8-266780ca5971" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "524fb952-2eab-5a48-87d8-266780ca5971" :answer/value "\\pi"] [:db/ensure "524fb952-2eab-5a48-87d8-266780ca5971" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8872060e-15bf-590a-bf77-9b4df5106182" :answer-field/id #uuid "8872060e-15bf-590a-bf77-9b4df5106182"] [:db/add "8872060e-15bf-590a-bf77-9b4df5106182" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "8872060e-15bf-590a-bf77-9b4df5106182" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "8872060e-15bf-590a-bf77-9b4df5106182" :answer-field/choices "524fb952-2eab-5a48-87d8-266780ca5971"] [:db/add "8872060e-15bf-590a-bf77-9b4df5106182" :answer-field/correct "524fb952-2eab-5a48-87d8-266780ca5971"] [:db/ensure "8872060e-15bf-590a-bf77-9b4df5106182" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "9fa48c8e-d2b6-5eba-8ad3-f816664db3eb" :question/id #uuid "9fa48c8e-d2b6-5eba-8ad3-f816664db3eb"] [:db/add "9fa48c8e-d2b6-5eba-8ad3-f816664db3eb" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{5 \\sqrt{2}}{2}} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{25 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "9fa48c8e-d2b6-5eba-8ad3-f816664db3eb" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{5}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{25 - x^{2}}=5\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{5})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=5\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{4}{5}\\cdot 5=4$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{5 \\sqrt{2}}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{5 \\sqrt{2}}{2}} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{25 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}\\right)=4\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\pi.\n$$"] [:db/add "9fa48c8e-d2b6-5eba-8ad3-f816664db3eb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "9fa48c8e-d2b6-5eba-8ad3-f816664db3eb" :question/answer-fields "8872060e-15bf-590a-bf77-9b4df5106182"] [:db/ensure "9fa48c8e-d2b6-5eba-8ad3-f816664db3eb" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "9fa48c8e-d2b6-5eba-8ad3-f816664db3eb"] [:db/add "ede60e48-9cdd-536f-b441-48e9615792ef" :answer/id #uuid "ede60e48-9cdd-536f-b441-48e9615792ef"] [:db/add "ede60e48-9cdd-536f-b441-48e9615792ef" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ede60e48-9cdd-536f-b441-48e9615792ef" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "ede60e48-9cdd-536f-b441-48e9615792ef" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e4e0a536-3443-5d5d-926c-ef349b9c9b62" :answer-field/id #uuid "e4e0a536-3443-5d5d-926c-ef349b9c9b62"] [:db/add "e4e0a536-3443-5d5d-926c-ef349b9c9b62" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "e4e0a536-3443-5d5d-926c-ef349b9c9b62" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "e4e0a536-3443-5d5d-926c-ef349b9c9b62" :answer-field/choices "ede60e48-9cdd-536f-b441-48e9615792ef"] [:db/add "e4e0a536-3443-5d5d-926c-ef349b9c9b62" :answer-field/correct "ede60e48-9cdd-536f-b441-48e9615792ef"] [:db/ensure "e4e0a536-3443-5d5d-926c-ef349b9c9b62" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b5286232-dcfd-5ef5-b3e2-5f7420d2ca2f" :question/id #uuid "b5286232-dcfd-5ef5-b3e2-5f7420d2ca2f"] [:db/add "b5286232-dcfd-5ef5-b3e2-5f7420d2ca2f" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-4}^{4} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "b5286232-dcfd-5ef5-b3e2-5f7420d2ca2f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 16=16\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot 4=\\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-4&\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\x=4&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-4}^{4} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(-1 \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{4},\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{-1}^{1}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{4}.\n$$"] [:db/add "b5286232-dcfd-5ef5-b3e2-5f7420d2ca2f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "b5286232-dcfd-5ef5-b3e2-5f7420d2ca2f" :question/answer-fields "e4e0a536-3443-5d5d-926c-ef349b9c9b62"] [:db/ensure "b5286232-dcfd-5ef5-b3e2-5f7420d2ca2f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "b5286232-dcfd-5ef5-b3e2-5f7420d2ca2f"] [:db/add "b6d82fcd-f8e6-5c42-9362-e0c21d7f479f" :answer/id #uuid "b6d82fcd-f8e6-5c42-9362-e0c21d7f479f"] [:db/add "b6d82fcd-f8e6-5c42-9362-e0c21d7f479f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b6d82fcd-f8e6-5c42-9362-e0c21d7f479f" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "b6d82fcd-f8e6-5c42-9362-e0c21d7f479f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5071aab3-0b63-575b-8580-6b3743d0842b" :answer-field/id #uuid "5071aab3-0b63-575b-8580-6b3743d0842b"] [:db/add "5071aab3-0b63-575b-8580-6b3743d0842b" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "5071aab3-0b63-575b-8580-6b3743d0842b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "5071aab3-0b63-575b-8580-6b3743d0842b" :answer-field/choices "b6d82fcd-f8e6-5c42-9362-e0c21d7f479f"] [:db/add "5071aab3-0b63-575b-8580-6b3743d0842b" :answer-field/correct "b6d82fcd-f8e6-5c42-9362-e0c21d7f479f"] [:db/ensure "5071aab3-0b63-575b-8580-6b3743d0842b" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0ee19251-9ec3-50f8-afac-37a3b36232b0" :question/id #uuid "0ee19251-9ec3-50f8-afac-37a3b36232b0"] [:db/add "0ee19251-9ec3-50f8-afac-37a3b36232b0" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{3}{2}}^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "0ee19251-9ec3-50f8-afac-37a3b36232b0" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 3=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{3}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{1}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{3}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{3}{2}}^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(- \\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{6},\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "0ee19251-9ec3-50f8-afac-37a3b36232b0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "0ee19251-9ec3-50f8-afac-37a3b36232b0" :question/answer-fields "5071aab3-0b63-575b-8580-6b3743d0842b"] [:db/ensure "0ee19251-9ec3-50f8-afac-37a3b36232b0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "0ee19251-9ec3-50f8-afac-37a3b36232b0"] [:db/add "57a22543-28d5-5089-8691-a57799840d66" :answer/id #uuid "57a22543-28d5-5089-8691-a57799840d66"] [:db/add "57a22543-28d5-5089-8691-a57799840d66" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "57a22543-28d5-5089-8691-a57799840d66" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{18}"] [:db/ensure "57a22543-28d5-5089-8691-a57799840d66" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1f2fd66c-c278-5547-a2e0-a6c78f6e834b" :answer-field/id #uuid "1f2fd66c-c278-5547-a2e0-a6c78f6e834b"] [:db/add "1f2fd66c-c278-5547-a2e0-a6c78f6e834b" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "1f2fd66c-c278-5547-a2e0-a6c78f6e834b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "1f2fd66c-c278-5547-a2e0-a6c78f6e834b" :answer-field/choices "57a22543-28d5-5089-8691-a57799840d66"] [:db/add "1f2fd66c-c278-5547-a2e0-a6c78f6e834b" :answer-field/correct "57a22543-28d5-5089-8691-a57799840d66"] [:db/ensure "1f2fd66c-c278-5547-a2e0-a6c78f6e834b" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ba24a3c5-0af8-5f12-bad0-104365814844" :question/id #uuid "ba24a3c5-0af8-5f12-bad0-104365814844"] [:db/add "ba24a3c5-0af8-5f12-bad0-104365814844" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\sqrt{3}}^{3} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "ba24a3c5-0af8-5f12-bad0-104365814844" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 9=9\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot 3=\\frac{2}{3}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\sqrt{3}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\\\x=3&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\sqrt{3}}^{3} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6},\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}}^{1}\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{18}.\n$$"] [:db/add "ba24a3c5-0af8-5f12-bad0-104365814844" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "ba24a3c5-0af8-5f12-bad0-104365814844" :question/answer-fields "1f2fd66c-c278-5547-a2e0-a6c78f6e834b"] [:db/ensure "ba24a3c5-0af8-5f12-bad0-104365814844" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "ba24a3c5-0af8-5f12-bad0-104365814844"] [:db/add "fe9023ae-c864-5d76-9a15-13dce5a7ca60" :answer/id #uuid "fe9023ae-c864-5d76-9a15-13dce5a7ca60"] [:db/add "fe9023ae-c864-5d76-9a15-13dce5a7ca60" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fe9023ae-c864-5d76-9a15-13dce5a7ca60" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "fe9023ae-c864-5d76-9a15-13dce5a7ca60" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d6296145-a5c1-5ba5-8007-818515d6ea25" :answer-field/id #uuid "d6296145-a5c1-5ba5-8007-818515d6ea25"] [:db/add "d6296145-a5c1-5ba5-8007-818515d6ea25" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "d6296145-a5c1-5ba5-8007-818515d6ea25" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "d6296145-a5c1-5ba5-8007-818515d6ea25" :answer-field/choices "fe9023ae-c864-5d76-9a15-13dce5a7ca60"] [:db/add "d6296145-a5c1-5ba5-8007-818515d6ea25" :answer-field/correct "fe9023ae-c864-5d76-9a15-13dce5a7ca60"] [:db/ensure "d6296145-a5c1-5ba5-8007-818515d6ea25" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6ac272a5-80c3-5610-9fdd-20599dd9ef28" :question/id #uuid "6ac272a5-80c3-5610-9fdd-20599dd9ef28"] [:db/add "6ac272a5-80c3-5610-9fdd-20599dd9ef28" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{1}^{\\sqrt{2}} \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "6ac272a5-80c3-5610-9fdd-20599dd9ef28" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot 2=3$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\\\x=\\sqrt{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{1}^{\\sqrt{2}} \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6},\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}\\right)=3\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{4}.\n$$"] [:db/add "6ac272a5-80c3-5610-9fdd-20599dd9ef28" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "6ac272a5-80c3-5610-9fdd-20599dd9ef28" :question/answer-fields "d6296145-a5c1-5ba5-8007-818515d6ea25"] [:db/ensure "6ac272a5-80c3-5610-9fdd-20599dd9ef28" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "6ac272a5-80c3-5610-9fdd-20599dd9ef28"] [:db/add "40273959-2eca-5a2a-a6a7-913201d413de" :answer/id #uuid "40273959-2eca-5a2a-a6a7-913201d413de"] [:db/add "40273959-2eca-5a2a-a6a7-913201d413de" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "40273959-2eca-5a2a-a6a7-913201d413de" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "40273959-2eca-5a2a-a6a7-913201d413de" :answer/validate] [:db/add "09c91fae-ab49-5eff-b2ea-057cfd6a2c41" :answer-field/id #uuid "09c91fae-ab49-5eff-b2ea-057cfd6a2c41"] [:db/add "09c91fae-ab49-5eff-b2ea-057cfd6a2c41" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "09c91fae-ab49-5eff-b2ea-057cfd6a2c41" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "09c91fae-ab49-5eff-b2ea-057cfd6a2c41" :answer-field/choices "40273959-2eca-5a2a-a6a7-913201d413de"] [:db/add "09c91fae-ab49-5eff-b2ea-057cfd6a2c41" :answer-field/correct "40273959-2eca-5a2a-a6a7-913201d413de"] [:db/ensure "09c91fae-ab49-5eff-b2ea-057cfd6a2c41" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c869aede-5705-526d-966e-bd4ade14be8a" :question/id #uuid "c869aede-5705-526d-966e-bd4ade14be8a"] [:db/add "c869aede-5705-526d-966e-bd4ade14be8a" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "c869aede-5705-526d-966e-bd4ade14be8a" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{2 - x^{2}}=\\sqrt{2}\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{2}=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{4}.\n$$"] [:db/add "c869aede-5705-526d-966e-bd4ade14be8a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "c869aede-5705-526d-966e-bd4ade14be8a" :question/answer-fields "09c91fae-ab49-5eff-b2ea-057cfd6a2c41"] [:db/ensure "c869aede-5705-526d-966e-bd4ade14be8a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "c869aede-5705-526d-966e-bd4ade14be8a"] [:db/add "0a7abc9f-93c1-51ac-91c8-84d0387c912a" :answer/id #uuid "0a7abc9f-93c1-51ac-91c8-84d0387c912a"] [:db/add "0a7abc9f-93c1-51ac-91c8-84d0387c912a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0a7abc9f-93c1-51ac-91c8-84d0387c912a" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{18}"] [:db/ensure "0a7abc9f-93c1-51ac-91c8-84d0387c912a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "66395239-5556-58ae-96ea-5eb4b32ef4c7" :answer-field/id #uuid "66395239-5556-58ae-96ea-5eb4b32ef4c7"] [:db/add "66395239-5556-58ae-96ea-5eb4b32ef4c7" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "66395239-5556-58ae-96ea-5eb4b32ef4c7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "66395239-5556-58ae-96ea-5eb4b32ef4c7" :answer-field/choices "0a7abc9f-93c1-51ac-91c8-84d0387c912a"] [:db/add "66395239-5556-58ae-96ea-5eb4b32ef4c7" :answer-field/correct "0a7abc9f-93c1-51ac-91c8-84d0387c912a"] [:db/ensure "66395239-5556-58ae-96ea-5eb4b32ef4c7" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "d5f42ff5-5444-50e8-91bf-056a3b48e465" :question/id #uuid "d5f42ff5-5444-50e8-91bf-056a3b48e465"] [:db/add "d5f42ff5-5444-50e8-91bf-056a3b48e465" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "d5f42ff5-5444-50e8-91bf-056a3b48e465" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 3=3\\left(1+(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\sqrt{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\sqrt{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}}\\right)=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{18}.\n$$"] [:db/add "d5f42ff5-5444-50e8-91bf-056a3b48e465" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "d5f42ff5-5444-50e8-91bf-056a3b48e465" :question/answer-fields "66395239-5556-58ae-96ea-5eb4b32ef4c7"] [:db/ensure "d5f42ff5-5444-50e8-91bf-056a3b48e465" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "d5f42ff5-5444-50e8-91bf-056a3b48e465"] [:db/add "ef654d89-f93f-534f-ab9f-1a9989542a07" :answer/id #uuid "ef654d89-f93f-534f-ab9f-1a9989542a07"] [:db/add "ef654d89-f93f-534f-ab9f-1a9989542a07" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ef654d89-f93f-534f-ab9f-1a9989542a07" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{2}"] [:db/ensure "ef654d89-f93f-534f-ab9f-1a9989542a07" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f244f8d2-4622-55b9-8ad2-276b6fcf3652" :answer-field/id #uuid "f244f8d2-4622-55b9-8ad2-276b6fcf3652"] [:db/add "f244f8d2-4622-55b9-8ad2-276b6fcf3652" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "f244f8d2-4622-55b9-8ad2-276b6fcf3652" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "f244f8d2-4622-55b9-8ad2-276b6fcf3652" :answer-field/choices "ef654d89-f93f-534f-ab9f-1a9989542a07"] [:db/add "f244f8d2-4622-55b9-8ad2-276b6fcf3652" :answer-field/correct "ef654d89-f93f-534f-ab9f-1a9989542a07"] [:db/ensure "f244f8d2-4622-55b9-8ad2-276b6fcf3652" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "fc989089-ee91-5602-b354-1363e3229631" :question/id #uuid "fc989089-ee91-5602-b354-1363e3229631"] [:db/add "fc989089-ee91-5602-b354-1363e3229631" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-1}^{0} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "fc989089-ee91-5602-b354-1363e3229631" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{2 - x^{2}}=\\sqrt{2}\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{2}=2$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-1&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-1}^{0} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int_{- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}^{0} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{4},\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}^{0}\\right)=2\\left(\\left(0\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "fc989089-ee91-5602-b354-1363e3229631" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "fc989089-ee91-5602-b354-1363e3229631" :question/answer-fields "f244f8d2-4622-55b9-8ad2-276b6fcf3652"] [:db/ensure "fc989089-ee91-5602-b354-1363e3229631" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "fc989089-ee91-5602-b354-1363e3229631"] [:db/add "af8c3b5d-659b-5ca4-8e21-2fc11a7d934b" :answer/id #uuid "af8c3b5d-659b-5ca4-8e21-2fc11a7d934b"] [:db/add "af8c3b5d-659b-5ca4-8e21-2fc11a7d934b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "af8c3b5d-659b-5ca4-8e21-2fc11a7d934b" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{18}"] [:db/ensure "af8c3b5d-659b-5ca4-8e21-2fc11a7d934b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e1fb631e-8d15-57f6-8580-ccaede1aab9a" :answer-field/id #uuid "e1fb631e-8d15-57f6-8580-ccaede1aab9a"] [:db/add "e1fb631e-8d15-57f6-8580-ccaede1aab9a" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "e1fb631e-8d15-57f6-8580-ccaede1aab9a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "e1fb631e-8d15-57f6-8580-ccaede1aab9a" :answer-field/choices "af8c3b5d-659b-5ca4-8e21-2fc11a7d934b"] [:db/add "e1fb631e-8d15-57f6-8580-ccaede1aab9a" :answer-field/correct "af8c3b5d-659b-5ca4-8e21-2fc11a7d934b"] [:db/ensure "e1fb631e-8d15-57f6-8580-ccaede1aab9a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "58813c00-a5b8-5081-ba5b-d06a58cf7795" :question/id #uuid "58813c00-a5b8-5081-ba5b-d06a58cf7795"] [:db/add "58813c00-a5b8-5081-ba5b-d06a58cf7795" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-6}^{0} \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 12}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "58813c00-a5b8-5081-ba5b-d06a58cf7795" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{6}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 12=12\\left(1+(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{6})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2 \\sqrt{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{12}\\cdot 2 \\sqrt{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-6&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\sqrt{3}\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-6}^{0} \\frac{1}{x^{2} + 12}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}\\left(\\int_{- \\sqrt{3}}^{0} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(- \\sqrt{3} \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{3},\\quad \\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\sqrt{3}}^{0}\\right)=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}\\left(\\left(0\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{18}.\n$$"] [:db/add "58813c00-a5b8-5081-ba5b-d06a58cf7795" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "58813c00-a5b8-5081-ba5b-d06a58cf7795" :question/answer-fields "e1fb631e-8d15-57f6-8580-ccaede1aab9a"] [:db/ensure "58813c00-a5b8-5081-ba5b-d06a58cf7795" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "58813c00-a5b8-5081-ba5b-d06a58cf7795"] [:db/add "04595e05-af1c-50aa-a0de-42138b20dda7" :answer/id #uuid "04595e05-af1c-50aa-a0de-42138b20dda7"] [:db/add "04595e05-af1c-50aa-a0de-42138b20dda7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "04595e05-af1c-50aa-a0de-42138b20dda7" :answer/value "2 \\pi"] [:db/ensure "04595e05-af1c-50aa-a0de-42138b20dda7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "45409891-4b88-5e6c-8425-841fb8302e5a" :answer-field/id #uuid "45409891-4b88-5e6c-8425-841fb8302e5a"] [:db/add "45409891-4b88-5e6c-8425-841fb8302e5a" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "45409891-4b88-5e6c-8425-841fb8302e5a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "45409891-4b88-5e6c-8425-841fb8302e5a" :answer-field/choices "04595e05-af1c-50aa-a0de-42138b20dda7"] [:db/add "45409891-4b88-5e6c-8425-841fb8302e5a" :answer-field/correct "04595e05-af1c-50aa-a0de-42138b20dda7"] [:db/ensure "45409891-4b88-5e6c-8425-841fb8302e5a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0f7e23d7-f594-5f67-b9ed-c802d03ed782" :question/id #uuid "0f7e23d7-f594-5f67-b9ed-c802d03ed782"] [:db/add "0f7e23d7-f594-5f67-b9ed-c802d03ed782" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{2 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "0f7e23d7-f594-5f67-b9ed-c802d03ed782" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{2 - x^{2}}=\\sqrt{2}\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2 \\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{2}=4$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-1&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-1}^{1} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{2 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int_{- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{4},\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}\\right)=4\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n2 \\pi.\n$$"] [:db/add "0f7e23d7-f594-5f67-b9ed-c802d03ed782" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "0f7e23d7-f594-5f67-b9ed-c802d03ed782" :question/answer-fields "45409891-4b88-5e6c-8425-841fb8302e5a"] [:db/ensure "0f7e23d7-f594-5f67-b9ed-c802d03ed782" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "0f7e23d7-f594-5f67-b9ed-c802d03ed782"] [:db/add "c7644753-abd6-5ed7-a994-0f807b480077" :answer/id #uuid "c7644753-abd6-5ed7-a994-0f807b480077"] [:db/add "c7644753-abd6-5ed7-a994-0f807b480077" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c7644753-abd6-5ed7-a994-0f807b480077" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{9}"] [:db/ensure "c7644753-abd6-5ed7-a994-0f807b480077" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f3b1e437-277c-50aa-93b5-e24edf0fcc97" :answer-field/id #uuid "f3b1e437-277c-50aa-93b5-e24edf0fcc97"] [:db/add "f3b1e437-277c-50aa-93b5-e24edf0fcc97" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "f3b1e437-277c-50aa-93b5-e24edf0fcc97" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "f3b1e437-277c-50aa-93b5-e24edf0fcc97" :answer-field/choices "c7644753-abd6-5ed7-a994-0f807b480077"] [:db/add "f3b1e437-277c-50aa-93b5-e24edf0fcc97" :answer-field/correct "c7644753-abd6-5ed7-a994-0f807b480077"] [:db/ensure "f3b1e437-277c-50aa-93b5-e24edf0fcc97" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1a481085-117b-5999-ad76-8e19a57728c7" :question/id #uuid "1a481085-117b-5999-ad76-8e19a57728c7"] [:db/add "1a481085-117b-5999-ad76-8e19a57728c7" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{-2}^{2} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 12}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "1a481085-117b-5999-ad76-8e19a57728c7" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{6}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 12=12\\left(1+(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{6})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2 \\sqrt{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{6}\\cdot 2 \\sqrt{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=-2&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\\\x=2&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{-2}^{2} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 12}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\left(\\int_{- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\right)}=- \\frac{\\pi}{6},\\quad \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}}\\right)=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{9}.\n$$"] [:db/add "1a481085-117b-5999-ad76-8e19a57728c7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "1a481085-117b-5999-ad76-8e19a57728c7" :question/answer-fields "f3b1e437-277c-50aa-93b5-e24edf0fcc97"] [:db/ensure "1a481085-117b-5999-ad76-8e19a57728c7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "1a481085-117b-5999-ad76-8e19a57728c7"] [:db/add "a97417d9-94a6-5980-8d46-a467807fab3a" :answer/id #uuid "a97417d9-94a6-5980-8d46-a467807fab3a"] [:db/add "a97417d9-94a6-5980-8d46-a467807fab3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a97417d9-94a6-5980-8d46-a467807fab3a" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "a97417d9-94a6-5980-8d46-a467807fab3a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "59b750ac-74c2-5c4b-b6bb-f67db8dbc51d" :answer-field/id #uuid "59b750ac-74c2-5c4b-b6bb-f67db8dbc51d"] [:db/add "59b750ac-74c2-5c4b-b6bb-f67db8dbc51d" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "59b750ac-74c2-5c4b-b6bb-f67db8dbc51d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "59b750ac-74c2-5c4b-b6bb-f67db8dbc51d" :answer-field/choices "a97417d9-94a6-5980-8d46-a467807fab3a"] [:db/add "59b750ac-74c2-5c4b-b6bb-f67db8dbc51d" :answer-field/correct "a97417d9-94a6-5980-8d46-a467807fab3a"] [:db/ensure "59b750ac-74c2-5c4b-b6bb-f67db8dbc51d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1371c8ad-ea4c-52bc-a8be-cbd7cd21bedd" :question/id #uuid "1371c8ad-ea4c-52bc-a8be-cbd7cd21bedd"] [:db/add "1371c8ad-ea4c-52bc-a8be-cbd7cd21bedd" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\sqrt{2}}^{2} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{8 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "1371c8ad-ea4c-52bc-a8be-cbd7cd21bedd" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{8 - x^{2}}=2 \\sqrt{2}\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{\\sqrt{2} x}{4})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2 \\sqrt{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\sqrt{2}\\cdot 2 \\sqrt{2}=4$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\sqrt{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\\\x=2&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\sqrt{2}}^{2} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{8 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6},\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}\\right)=4\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "1371c8ad-ea4c-52bc-a8be-cbd7cd21bedd" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "1371c8ad-ea4c-52bc-a8be-cbd7cd21bedd" :question/answer-fields "59b750ac-74c2-5c4b-b6bb-f67db8dbc51d"] [:db/ensure "1371c8ad-ea4c-52bc-a8be-cbd7cd21bedd" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "1371c8ad-ea4c-52bc-a8be-cbd7cd21bedd"] [:db/add "1b7e900f-58c5-54d9-b4dd-e9243a1038d7" :answer/id #uuid "1b7e900f-58c5-54d9-b4dd-e9243a1038d7"] [:db/add "1b7e900f-58c5-54d9-b4dd-e9243a1038d7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1b7e900f-58c5-54d9-b4dd-e9243a1038d7" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{9}"] [:db/ensure "1b7e900f-58c5-54d9-b4dd-e9243a1038d7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a2b6a189-cc62-5331-bc4a-c392adb11139" :answer-field/id #uuid "a2b6a189-cc62-5331-bc4a-c392adb11139"] [:db/add "a2b6a189-cc62-5331-bc4a-c392adb11139" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "a2b6a189-cc62-5331-bc4a-c392adb11139" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a2b6a189-cc62-5331-bc4a-c392adb11139" :answer-field/choices "1b7e900f-58c5-54d9-b4dd-e9243a1038d7"] [:db/add "a2b6a189-cc62-5331-bc4a-c392adb11139" :answer-field/correct "1b7e900f-58c5-54d9-b4dd-e9243a1038d7"] [:db/ensure "a2b6a189-cc62-5331-bc4a-c392adb11139" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f52e547a-67c6-54a7-8d53-a6934739d311" :question/id #uuid "f52e547a-67c6-54a7-8d53-a6934739d311"] [:db/add "f52e547a-67c6-54a7-8d53-a6934739d311" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{1}^{3} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "f52e547a-67c6-54a7-8d53-a6934739d311" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 3=3\\left(1+(\\frac{\\sqrt{3} x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\sqrt{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot \\sqrt{3}=\\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{3}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\\\x=3&\\Longrightarrow u=\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{1}^{3} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}}^{\\sqrt{3}} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6},\\quad \\arctan{\\left(\\sqrt{3} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{3}$.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEvaluate the primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{3}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\right)=\\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{3}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{9}.\n$$"] [:db/add "f52e547a-67c6-54a7-8d53-a6934739d311" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "f52e547a-67c6-54a7-8d53-a6934739d311" :question/answer-fields "a2b6a189-cc62-5331-bc4a-c392adb11139"] [:db/ensure "f52e547a-67c6-54a7-8d53-a6934739d311" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "f52e547a-67c6-54a7-8d53-a6934739d311"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "8c22f0e5-32e8-55ff-991a-f892a28244bd"] [:db/add "